                            <comment id="16669942" author="ignitetcbot" created="Wed, 31 Oct 2018 11:01:58 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2199624&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity Run All Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16669952" author="xtern" created="Wed, 31 Oct 2018 11:07:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sergey-chugunov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sergey-chugunov&quot;&gt;sergey-chugunov&lt;/a&gt;, review these changes, please.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16671260" author="sergey-chugunov" created="Thu, 1 Nov 2018 08:34:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=xtern&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;xtern&quot;&gt;xtern&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Change looks good to me, it makes the test more stable and eliminates the root cause of some flaky failures its previous implementation suffered from.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In a nutshell, prev impl relied on threads interruption when exiting the test but some threads may be sitting in stopGrid method at the moment of interruption. Our test framework treat interruption inside this method as an error during the test and fails it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So as it is fixed in new implementation and we have an approval from the bot, we could proceed with merging.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dpavlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dpavlov&quot;&gt;dpavlov&lt;/a&gt;, could you please take a look?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16681153" author="agoncharuk" created="Fri, 9 Nov 2018 09:40:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=xtern&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;xtern&quot;&gt;xtern&lt;/a&gt;, merged your changes to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16681158" author="githubbot" created="Fri, 9 Nov 2018 09:43:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user asfgit closed the pull request at:&lt;/p&gt;

